# libical, target cross: the host build that gives the target one its ical-glib-src-generator
### Installed into the platform toolchain because it links the GLib of lfs/GLib:cross; the
### libxml2 is the one of the host. Not the default build: the values of package.env it drops
PKG_DEPS="lfs/GLib"
### cmakebuild declares every build a cross compilation, and a cross compiling libical imports
### the generator instead of building it
CONF_FLAGS="${LIBICAL_COMMON_FLAGS} -DCMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING:BOOL=OFF"
